  "full_response": "**Chat Transcript: Bank Account Verification**\n\n---\n\n**Bank Agent (BA):** Hello! Thank you for contacting [Bank Name] Customer Support. My name is Alex. How can I assist you today?\n\n**Customer (C):** Hi Alex, I need help with a transaction issue on my account.\n\n**BA:** I’d be happy to assist you with that. For security purposes, could you please verify your account details? I’ll need your:\n- Full name (as registered with the bank)\n- Account number\n- Routing number\n- Date of birth\n\n**C:** Sure, no problem.\n- Full name: Sarah Johnson\n- Account number: 1234567890\n- Routing number: 021000021\n- Date of birth: 05/15/1985\n\n**BA:** Thank you, Sarah. Let me verify these details in our system. *Pause* Great, your account is verified. To ensure security, I won’t repeat your full details. Now, how can I assist you with your transaction issue?\n\n**C:** Thanks! I noticed a pending charge from an online store I don’t recognize. Can you help me check if it’s legitimate?\n\n**BA:** Absolutely. Let me pull up your recent transactions. *Pause* I see a pending charge of $49.99 from \"ShopEase Online\" on [date]. Does that sound familiar?\n\n**C:** No, that’s not me. What should I do?\n\n**BA:** I’ll flag this as a potential unauthorized transaction and initiate a dispute. For your security, I’ll also temporarily freeze your card to prevent further charges. Would you like a replacement card sent to your registered address?\n\n**C:** Yes, please. That would be great.\n\n**BA:** Done. Your new card should arrive in 5–7 business days. In the meantime, I’ll email you a confirmation of the dispute and next steps. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?\n\n**C:** No, that covers it. Thank you so much for your help!\n\n**BA:** You’re welcome, Sarah! If you have any other questions, feel free to reach out. Have a great day, and stay safe.\n\n**C:** You too! Bye.\n\n**BA:** Goodbye!\n\n---\n*End of chat*",
